  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nIt seems that we have a problem with Synapse when the server that hosts it has suffered a too big desynchronization in terms of the time and date of the machine. (ex: year 2250)\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- put the server in 2250\r\n- \r\n<!--\r\nsynapse then causes huge latency on the serve\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n<!-- IMPORTANT: please answer the following questions, to help us narrow down the problem -->\r\n\r\n<!-- Was this issue identified on matrix.org or another homeserver? -->\r\n- gofast-comm.ceo-vision.com\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n What version of Synapse is running?\r\n\r\n-->\r\n- **Version**:\r\n1.12.4\r\n- **Install method**:\r\ncurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ma1uta/matrix-synapse-rest-password-provider/master/rest_auth_provider.py -o /opt/synapse/lib/python3.6/site-packages/rest_auth_provider.py\r\n\r\n- **Platform**:\r\nCentOS 7\r\n\r\n",
